    <!-- ============================================ -->
    <!-- SCENARIO INFORMATION                        -->
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    <!--
    CONTAMINATION SOURCE LOCALIZATION
    ==================================
    
    Mission: Locate contamination source hidden inside warehouse
    
    ROBOT SPAWN POSITIONS:
    - Drone: (-25, 20, 2.5) - Aerial survey start
    - Rover: (-25, 15, 0.5) - Ground support
    
    CONTAMINATION ZONES (from source at 15, -10):
    - Critical (red):     0-5m   radius - Value: 100
    - High (orange-red):  5-12m  radius - Value: 80
    - Medium (orange):    12-20m radius - Value: 60
    - Low (yellow):       20-30m radius - Value: 40
    - Trace (yellow-grn): 30-45m radius - Value: 20
    - Clean (green):      >45m          - Value: 0
    
    CODE MOBILITY TRIGGER:
    When drone determines source is inside warehouse
    (covered structure), migrate gradient-following
    algorithm to rover for ground-level investigation.
    
    Warehouse door opening: Front side (positive Y)
    ==================================
    -->

  </world>
</sdf>
